#### **Batch ’11 is not just a chapter of our lives—it’s a story that continues to live within each of us.**

\
It began in the classrooms of Kashiani G.C. Pilot High School, where ordinary days quietly turned into the most unforgettable moments. The sound of the school bell, the rush through corridors, the laughter shared on the last bench, the nervous silence before exams, and the dreams we carried in our hearts—those memories are now timeless treasures.

Back then, we didn’t realize how special those moments were. We were simply living them—forming friendships that would outlast distance, creating bonds that time could never erase. Teachers guided us, friends stood beside us, and together we built a foundation that shaped not only our education but our character and values.

As the years passed, life took us in different directions. Some of us stayed close to home, while others traveled far beyond, chasing dreams across cities and countries. We became professionals, entrepreneurs, creators, and leaders in our own ways. Yet, no matter how far we go or how much we change, a part of us will always belong to that shared beginning.

This platform is more than just a website—it is a home for our memories. A place where we reconnect, relive the past, and celebrate the journey we’ve taken. It’s a reminder that while time moves forward, the spirit of Batch ’11 remains unchanged—strong, united, and full of life.

Because in the end, it was never just about a school or a year.\
It was about **us**—our friendship, our journey, and the legacy we continue to carry forward.
